<title>INDIA: Peru's Fujimori to visit India on May 25.</title>
<headline>Peru's Fujimori to visit India on May 25.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peruvian President Alberto Fujimori will visit India between May 25 and 28 at the invitation of President Shankar Dayal Sharma, the Indian Foreign Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;This will be the first ever visit at this level between the two countries,&quot; the ministry said in a statement.</p>
